E_E1 OUT+ OUT- TABLE { V(IN+, IN-) } = (0.122,0.122)(1.102,1.073)(1.29, 1.5)(1.959,1.817)
+ (2.571,2.378)(3.184,2.524)(3.551,2.598)(4.286,2.707)(7.469,2.720)
